    "Rinse the cod under cold water and pat dry with paper towels.",
    "Thread the cod onto the skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together olive oil, lemon juice, garlic, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Brush the mixture onto both sides of the cod.",
